  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$A=\\int_0^1(\\sqrt{x}-x) d x$\n$=\\left[\\frac{2}{3} x^{3 / 2}-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right]_0^1$\n$=\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{6}$.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/N4iFODxA066V2v36QU3cbbTNBQqtpPsvT5-CnCoXmFc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
